{"type": "umap", "geometry": {"type": "Point", "coordinates": [13.287963867187502, 52.45810145008196]}, "properties": {"ttl": {"300": "5 min", "3600": "1 hour", "86400": "1 day"}, "name": "Tempo 30 Potenziale Berlin", "tags": ["public"], "zoom": 11, "center": [13.287963867187502, 52.45810145008196], "fields": [], "licence": {"url": "http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/", "name": "ODbL"}, "overlay": {}, "slideshow": {}, "tilelayer": {"tms": false, "name": "Positron (Carto)", "maxZoom": 17, "minZoom": 0, "attribution": "&copy; [[http://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright|OpenStreetMap]] contributors, &copy; [[https://carto.com/attributions|CARTO]]", "url_template": "https://cartodb-basemaps-{s}.global.ssl.fastly.net/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=cb1_2ipg_1_a64e4bfb259752dcd3dc012c"}, "longCredit": "https://www.munichways.de/tempo-30-potentialkarte-muenchen/", "limitBounds": {}, "syncEnabled": true, "zoomControl": true, "fullscreenControl": true}, "uri": "http://umap.openstreetmap.de/de/map/tempo-30-potenziale-berlin_164527", "layers": [{"layers": [{"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [], "properties": {"fill": true, "heat": {}, "name": "Spielpl\u00e4tze", "type": "Default", "color": "White", "rules": [{"name": "Spielplatz an Tempo-50-Stra\u00dfenabschnitt", "condition": "potential_candidate=true", "properties": {"color": "Red", "opacity": 0.7, "fillOpacity": 0.7}}], "fields": [{"key": "potential_candidate", "type": "String"}, {"key": "display_role", "type": "String"}, {"key": "name", "type": "String"}, {"key": "potential_reason", "type": "String"}, {"key": "description", "type": "Text"}], "stroke": false, "circles": {"radius": {"min": 8}}, "cluster": {}, "browsable": true, "iconClass": "Circle", "inCaption": true, "choropleth": {"mode": "kmeans", "brewer": "Blues", "classes": 9}, "remoteData": {"ttl": "300", "url": "https://tempo-30.adfc-berlin.de/uMap/playgrounds.geojson", "proxy": true, "format": "geojson"}, "categorized": {"mode": "alpha", "brewer": "Blues"}, "description": "Gelten seit der StVO-Novelle als neu aufgenommene privilegierte Orte zum besonderen Schutz von Kindern. Gem\u00e4\u00df \u00a7 45 Abs. 9 Satz 4 Nr. 6 StVO kann im unmittelbaren Bereich (auf bis zu 300 Metern L\u00e4nge) nun erleichtert Tempo 30 angeordnet werden, ohne dass eine qualifizierte Gefahrenlage nachgewiesen werden muss.", "displayOnLoad": true}, "rank": 0}, {"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [], "properties": {"fill": false, "heat": {}, "name": "Zebrastreifen", "type": "Default", "color": "White", "rules": [{"name": "Ungesch\u00fctzte Zebrastreifen", "condition": "potential_candidate=true", "properties": {"color": "Red", "iconOpacity": 0.9}}], "fields": [{"key": "potential_candidate", "type": "String"}, {"key": "display_role", "type": "String"}, {"key": "description", "type": "Text"}, {"key": "potential_reason", "type": "String"}], "stroke": false, "weight": 6, "cluster": {}, "iconUrl": "|||", "browsable": true, "inCaption": true, "choropleth": {"mode": "kmeans", "brewer": "Blues", "classes": 9}, "remoteData": {"ttl": "300", "url": "https://tempo-30.adfc-berlin.de/uMap/zebra.geojson", "proxy": true, "format": "geojson", "dynamic": false}, "categorized": {"mode": "alpha", "brewer": "Blues"}, "description": "Gem\u00e4\u00df \u00a7 45 Abs. 9 Satz 4 Nr. 10 StVO kann im unmittelbaren Bereich eines Zebrastreifens nun erleichtert Tempo 30 angeordnet werden, ohne dass eine qualifizierte Gefahrenlage nachgewiesen werden muss.", "iconOpacity": 0.4, "displayOnLoad": true}, "rank": 1}, {"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [], "properties": {"name": "Einrichtungen f\u00fcr Menschen mit Behinderung", "color": "White", "rules": [{"name": "Ungesch\u00fctzte Einrichtungen f\u00fcr Menschen mit Behinderungen", "condition": "potential_candidate=true", "properties": {"color": "Red"}}], "fields": [{"key": "name", "type": "String"}, {"key": "potential_candidate", "type": "String"}, {"key": "website", "type": "String"}, {"key": "operator", "type": "String"}, {"key": "potential_reason", "type": "String"}, {"key": "description", "type": "Text"}, {"key": "osm_id", "type": "String"}, {"key": "element_type", "type": "String"}, {"key": "osm_url", "type": "String"}, {"key": "amenity", "type": "String"}, {"key": "social_facility", "type": "String"}, {"key": "social_facility_for", "type": "String"}, {"key": "imagery_reference", "type": "String"}, {"key": "street", "type": "String"}, {"key": "housenumber", "type": "String"}], "opacity": 0.2, "browsable": true, "iconClass": "Default", "inCaption": true, "remoteData": {"ttl": "3600", "url": "https://tempo-30.adfc-berlin.de/uMap/disability_facilities.geojson", "proxy": true, "format": "geojson"}, "description": "Wohnheime, Tagesst\u00e4tten, Werkst\u00e4tten, etc. sind seit der Reform explizit als gesch\u00fctzte sensible Orte im Stra\u00dfenverkehrsrecht verankert. Gem\u00e4\u00df \u00a7 45 Abs. 9 Satz 4 Nr. 6 StVO kann im unmittelbaren Bereich dieser Einrichtungen erleichtert Tempo 30 angeordnet werden, ohne dass der Nachweis einer qualifizierten Gefahrenlage erforderlich ist.", "displayOnLoad": true}, "rank": 2}, {"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [], "properties": {"fill": true, "heat": {}, "name": "Krankenh\u00e4user", "type": "Default", "color": "Blue", "rules": [{"name": "Krankenhaus an Tempo-50-Stra\u00dfenabschnitt", "condition": "potential_candidate=true", "properties": {"color": "Red", "opacity": 0.7, "fillOpacity": 0.7}}], "fields": [{"key": "potential_candidate", "type": "String"}, {"key": "display_role", "type": "String"}, {"key": "name", "type": "String"}, {"key": "potential_reason", "type": "String"}, {"key": "description", "type": "Text"}, {"key": "operator", "type": "String"}, {"key": "street", "type": "String"}, {"key": "housenumber", "type": "String"}, {"key": "website", "type": "String"}], "stroke": false, "circles": {"radius": {"min": 8}}, "cluster": {}, "browsable": true, "iconClass": "Default", "inCaption": true, "choropleth": {"mode": "kmeans